# 默认：让 Git 自动识别文本文件，仓库内统一以 LF 存储，
# 检出到工作区时按平台转换。这样可消除 Windows 下的 CRLF 警告。
* text=auto eol=lf

# ── 源码与配置：显式声明为文本，统一 LF ──
*.java   text eol=lf
*.xml    text eol=lf
*.md     text eol=lf
*.json   text eol=lf
*.gradle text eol=lf
*.pro    text eol=lf
*.txt    text eol=lf
*.yml    text eol=lf
*.yaml   text eol=lf
.gitignore      text eol=lf
.gitattributes  text eol=lf

# ── Windows 脚本：必须保持 CRLF，否则部分环境执行异常 ──
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# ── Unix 脚本：必须保持 LF ──
*.sh text eol=lf

# ── 二进制文件：禁止任何换行符转换与文本 diff ──
*.apk      binary
*.idsig    binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks      binary
*.jar      binary
*.aar      binary
*.so       binary
*.png      binary
*.jpg      binary
*.jpeg     binary
*.gif      binary
*.webp     binary
*.ico      binary
*.ttf      binary
*.otf      binary
*.zip      binary

# ── 语言统计：让 GitHub 按 Java 项目识别，忽略文档与脚本干扰 ──
docs/**       linguist-documentation
build-apk.ps1 linguist-vendored
